Hi Chris,

As requested, I have sent the first lines of the all.dat.tidy object to brainGr...@googlegroups.com. I believe the output here is correct in my opinion, my concern is the writing of the residuals to the  all.dat.resids$resids.all object. In terms of the covariates, I only have group (which was excluded as per the guide, and then age at scanning and gender). Therefore, my covars file includes only study.ID, group, sex, and age_scanning.

Also, the warning that is given during the get residuals code is as follows:

> all.dat.resids <- get.resid(all.dat.tidy, covars, exclude = 'Group')
Aggregate function missing, defaulting to 'length'

Thanks again for your help,

Dan

